This repository is the local scoring UI and engine. Weights, verdicts, and
JSON validation are implemented here.

The companion Ollama model `nebulatech/rasa-analyst` is derived from Meta
Llama 3.1. Use of that model is subject to the Llama 3.1 Community License:
https://www.llama.com/llama3_1/license/

RASA-Analyst is a GEO / AI-native discoverability aid. It does not claim
access to ChatGPT, Gemini, or other proprietary ranking internals.

Paper: Amit Verma & Sarita Agarwal, Retrieval-Aware Semantic Architectures
for AI-Native Search Systems, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20325460
